        <div xml:id="gom-ier39-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier39-Hd1e102">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier39-d1e104">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier39-Rd1e106" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ier39_17"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier39-Qd1e108" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier39_17@1-10">Et liberabo te. Qui sperant in Domino non confundentur<!-- check: Migne cites sap19; text matches ier39_17 --></quote>. <quote xml:id="gom-ier39-Qd1e112" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps24_4@1-4">Confundentur omnes iniqua agentes</quote>. Ecce principes qui animam Jeremiae quaerebant, captivantur. Eunuchus qui eum liberaverat perfecta potitus est libertate. Sic quoque liberatis sanctis praedicatoribus, persecutores aeterna ultione punientur.
          </p>
